irm Password · “Create Account” · “Already have an account? Login” • Media: Photo_Sign_Up • Social sign-up: “Sign up with Google” (Logo_Google) · “Sign up with Email” (Logo_Gmail) · “OR”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"7:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:62\" name=\"→ Create Account → 01_Home → Login → 08_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:63\" name=\"08_Sign_In\" x=\"668\" y=\"2240\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"7:64\" name=\"08_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"97\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:65\" name=\"Goal: Sign in to FASCO.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:67\" name=\"• Card: “FASCO” wordmark · “FASCO Terms &amp; Conditions” • Form: “Sign In To FASCO” · Email · Password · “Sign In” · “Register Now” · “Forgot Password?” • Media: Photo_Sign_In • Social sign-in: “Sign in with Google” (Logo_Google) · “Sign in with Email” (Logo_Gmail) · “OR”\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"7:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:69\" name=\"→ Sign In → 01_Home → Register Now → 07_Sign_Up → Forgot Password? → 09_Forgot_Password\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:70\" name=\"09_Forgot_Password\" x=\"0\" y=\"2620\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"7:71\" name=\"09_Forgot_Password\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"185\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:72\" name=\"Goal: Request a confirmation code to recover the account.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:74\" name=\"• Card: “FASCO” wordmark · “FASCO Terms &amp; Conditions” • Form: “Forgot Password” · First Name · Last Name · Email Address · Phone Number · “Send Confirmation Code” · “Already have an account? Login” • Media: Photo_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"7:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:76\" name=\"→ Send Confirmation Code → 10_Confirmation_Code → Login → 08_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:77\" name=\"10_Confirmation_Code\" x=\"668\" y=\"2620\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"7:78\" name=\"10_Confirmation_Code\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"199\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:79\" name=\"Goal: Enter the code that was e-mailed.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:81\" name=\"• Card: “FASCO” wordmark · “FASCO Terms &amp; Conditions” • Form: “Enter The Confirmation Code” · Confirmation Code · “Recover Account” · “Didn’t receive Confirmation Code? Resend Now” • Media: Photo_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"7:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:83\" name=\"→ Recover Account → 11_New_Password\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:84\" name=\"11_New_Password\" x=\"0\" y=\"2940\" width=\"644\" height=\"256\">\n          <text id=\"7:85\" name=\"11_New_Password\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"161\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:86\" name=\"Goal: Set a new password.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:87\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:88\" name=\"• Card: “FASCO” wordmark · “FASCO Terms &amp; Conditions” • Form: “Enter Your New Password” · New Password · Confirm Password · “Submit” • Media: Photo_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n          <text id=\"7:89\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"186\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:90\" name=\"→ Submit → 01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"212\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:91\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"3887\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"7:92\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:93\" name=\"• Two headers, as in the source: the home header on 01 (Home / Deals / New Arrivals / Packages, Sign in, Sign Up; current: Home) and the store header on 02–06 (Home / Shop / Products / Pages, then search, account, wishlist, cart; current: Shop on 02, Products on 03–04, none on 05–06; the cart shows count 1 on 04–06). How the current item looks is yours. • Footer variants: the home footer on 01, the store footer on 02–06. 07–11 are full-screen sign-in pages without header and footer. • Shopping flow: 01 SHOP NOW → 02_Shop → product card → 03_Product → Add to cart opens 04_Mini_Cart over the product page → View Cart → 05_Cart → Checkout → 06_Checkout (Checkout in the mini cart also goes straight to 06). • Account flow: Sign Up → 07 → Create Account → 01 · Sign in → 08 → Sign In → 01 · Forgot Password? → 09 → Send Confirmation Code → 10 → Recover Account → 11 → Submit → 01. Store header account → 08, cart → 05. • Entry only (no frame): Deals, New Arrivals, Packages, Products, Pages, search, wishlist, Buy Now, slide arrows, category tabs, filters, sort, view options, pagination, size / color / quantity, Compare, Ask a question, Share, gift wrap, Remove, Discount code, Pay Now, social sign-in buttons, Resend Now, Subscribe Now, footer links.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:94\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"4184\" width=\"1312\" height=\"911\">\n      <text id=\"7:95\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:96\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:97\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"822\">\n        <frame id=\"7:98\" name=\"Home copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\">\n          <text id=\"7:99\" name=\"Home copy\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:100\" name=\"Deals Of The Month: Hand-picked styles at their best prices this month — once the timer runs out, the deals are gone. New Arrivals: Fresh pieces just landed: easy dresses, cosy knits and everyday shirts for the new season. Instagram: Tag @fasco to be featured — real outfits from our community, styled your way. Testimonials: Real reviews from people who shop with FASCO. Newsletter: Be the first to hear about new arrivals, exclusive deals and styling tips. No spam — unsubscribe anytime.\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"190\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:101\" name=\"Collection banner (01, 02, 03)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"201\">\n          <text id=\"7:102\" name=\"Collection banner (01, 02, 03)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:103\" name=\"Men Collection · Classic Gentleman Item labels: Flat Cap · Cotton Shirt · Suspender · Leather Shoes DESCRIPTION: A sharp, vintage-inspired look built around a wool flat cap, a crisp cotton shirt and classic suspenders. Easy to dress up or down, and made to last for years. Size: M · $100.00 · Buy Now\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"133\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:104\" name=\"New Arrivals cards (01, in order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"182\">\n          <text id=\"7:105\" name=\"New Arrivals cards (01, in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:106\" name=\"Shiny Dress (Photo_Shiny_Dress) · Long Dress (Photo_Long_Dress) · Full Sweater (Photo_Full_Sweater) · White Dress (Photo_White_Dress) · Colorful Dress (Photo_Colorful_Dress) · White Shirt (Photo_White_Shirt) Each: brand FASCO · 5-star rating · (4.1k) Customer Reviews · $95.50 · Almost Sold Out\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"114\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:107\" name=\"Testimonials (01, in order)\" x=\"0\" y=\"282\" width=\"420\" height=\"258\">\n          <text id=\"7:108\" name=\"Testimonials (01, in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"178\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:109\" name=\"Suzan B. · UI Designer (Avatar_Suzan_B) — “The items I ordered were the best investment I ever made. I can’t say enough about your quality service.” James K. · Traveler (Avatar_James_K) — “You won’t regret it. I would like to personally thank you for your outstanding product. Absolutely wonderful!” Megen W. · UI Designer (Avatar_Megen_W) — “Just what I was looking for. Thank you for making it painless, pleasant and, most of all, hassle-free! All products are great.” All: 5-star rating\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"190\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:110\" name=\"People Also Loved (03)\" x=\"444\" y=\"282\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"7:111\" name=\"People Also Loved (03)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:112\" name=\"Copy: Shoppers who looked at this jacket also loved these deals — grab them before the timer runs out. Slides, countdown and card as in Deals Of The Month.\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:113\" name=\"Shop products (02, in order)\" x=\"888\" y=\"282\" width=\"420\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"7:114\" name=\"Shop products (02, in order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:115\" name=\"Rounded Red Hat · $8.00 (Photo_Rounded_Red_Hat) Linen-blend Shirt · $17.00 · Sold Out (Photo_Linen_Blend_Shirt) Long-sleeve Coat · $106.00 (Photo_Long_Sleeve_Coat) Boxy Denim Hat · $25.00 (Photo_Boxy_Denim_Hat) Linen Plain Top · $25.00 (Photo_Linen_Plain_Top) Oversized T-shirt · $11.00 · old $14.00 (Photo_Oversized_TShirt) Polarised Sunglasses · $18.00 · old $21.00 (Photo_Polarised_Sunglasses) Rockstar Jacket · $22.00 (Photo_Rockstar_Jacket) Dotted Black Dress · $20.00 (Photo_Dotted_Black_Dress)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"228\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:116\" name=\"Denim Jacket (03–06)\" x=\"0\" y=\"602\" width=\"420\" height=\"220\">\n          <text id=\"7:117\" name=\"Denim Jacket (03–06)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:118\" name=\"Brand FASCO · rating with (3) reviews · $39.00 · old $59.00 · Save 33% Sizes M · L · XL · XXL (selected M) · Colors Blue · Black · Lilac (selected Blue) Quantity 1 · 24 people are viewing this right now · Sale ends in 00 : 05 : 59 : 47 · Only 9 item(s) left in stock! Estimated Delivery: Jul 30 - Aug 03 · Free Shipping &amp; Returns: On all orders over $75\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"152\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:119\" name=\"Cart &amp; checkout totals\" x=\"444\" y=\"602\" width=\"420\" height=\"163\">\n          <text id=\"7:120\" name=\"Cart &amp; checkout totals\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:121\" name=\"Cart (04, 05): Denim Jacket · Color : Blue · 1 × $39.00 · Subtotal $39.00 · Buy $36.00 more and get Free Shipping · gift wrap “For $10.00 please wrap the product” unchecked Checkout (06): Subtotal $39.00 · Shipping $40.00 · Total $79.00\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"95\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:122\" name=\"Features strip\" x=\"888\" y=\"602\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"7:123\" name=\"Features strip\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"95\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:124\" name=\"High Quality · crafted from top materials (Icon_Trophy) Warranty Protection · Over 2 years (Icon_Guarantee) Free Shipping · Order over $75 (Icon_Shipping) 24 / 7 Support · Dedicated support (Icon_Support)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:125\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"5143\" width=\"1312\" height=\"332\">\n      <text id=\"7:126\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:127\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n        <frame id=\"7:128\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"7:129\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"7:130\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #000000, Volkhov and Poppins • Media: photos, avatars, sign-in logos, icons • Default Button, default Text Field\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:131\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"281\">\n          <text id=\"7:132\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"7:133\" name=\"• Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every page • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, sale and discount, rating, stock / urgency, links, error / disabled • Type scale (which levels use Volkhov), spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current nav item, current tab, current slide, selected size / color / view, sold out, checked, focused field, current page, cart count • Headers, footers, hero collage, brand strip, countdown, deal slider, tabs, product cards, collection banner, feature strip, Instagram strip, testimonial cards, newsletter, filters, gallery, pickers, stepper, mini cart, cart table, checkout form, order summary, auth cards • How photos are cropped and placed\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"200\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:134\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"5523\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"7:135\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:136\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"7:137\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current nav, tabs, selected options, sold out, cart count)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"7:138\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 11 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"115d8fd2-329d-45e7-8005-49ec3e8a31e3","uuid":"63d95957-65c7-4160-b921-88b7841b78d0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:01:21.962Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"7:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"5868\">\n    <frame id=\"7:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"7:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"7:5\" name=\"FASCO — fashion store website\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"7:6\" name=\"Design a fashion e-commerce website: land on the home page, browse the shop, open a product, add it to the cart, review the cart, check out, and sign up, sign in or recover an account. Desktop web, 1920 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"7:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 11 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the avatars, the sign-in logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3285\">\n      <text id=\"7:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"3196\">\n        <frame id=\"7:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"796\">\n          <text id=\"7:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:16\" name=\"Goal: Discover deals, new arrivals and the brand.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:18\" name=\"• Brands: Minimog · Retrolie · Brook · Learts · Vagabond (as wordmarks) • Collection banner: Photo_Collection with item labels “Flat Cap” · “Cotton Shirt” · “Suspender” · “Leather Shoes” · “Men Collection” · “Classic Gentleman” · “DESCRIPTION” · copy (see DATA) · “Size:” M · $100.00 · “Buy Now” • Deals Of The Month: “Deals Of The Month” · copy (see DATA) · “Buy Now” · “Hurry, Before It’s Too Late!” · countdown 02 Days · 06 Hr · 05 Mins · 30 Sec · deal slides Photo_Deal_1, Photo_Deal_2, Photo_Deal_3 · current slide card “01 — Spring Sale” · “30% OFF” · previous / next (Icon_Chevron_Left, Icon_Chevron_Right) · slide indicator: 4 slides, current 1 • Features: High Quality · Warranty Protection · Free Shipping · 24 / 7 Support, each with icon and line (see DATA) • Footer: “FASCO” · Support Center · Invoicing · Contract · Careers · Blog · FAQs · “Copyright © 2022 FASCO. All Rights Reserved.” • Header: “FASCO” wordm