{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Workspace page (8:2) is empty. I have all the info I need now:\n\n**Task summary:**\n- Build FASCO fashion e-commerce website with 11 frames in 03 · Workspace (page 8:2)\n- 1920 wide desktop, light mode\n- Brand color #000000, Volkhov (headings + wordmark), Poppins (UI text)\n- Reuse Button and Text Field components from 02 · Components (symbols 1:24 and 1:27)\n- Use media: photos, avatars, logos, icons (as components — I should copy them into workspace or create instances)\n- Prototype links\n\n**Frames to build:**\n1. **01_Home** — header (FASCO, Home/Deals/New Arrivals/Packages, Sign in, Sign Up), hero collage (Photo_Hero_Left, Top, Bottom, Right, ULTIMATE/SALE/NEW COLLECTION/SHOP NOW), brands strip (Minimog, Retrolie, Brook, Learts, Vagabond), Collection banner (Photo_Collection...), Deals Of The Month (countdown, 3 deal photos, slide card 01 — Spring Sale, 30% OFF, prev/next, indicator 4 slides current 1), Features strip (4 items), New Arrivals (tabs, 6 product cards), Newsletter, Testimonials (3 cards, current James K.), Instagram (7 photos), Footer (FASCO, Support Center, Invoicing, Contract, Careers, Blog, FAQs, copyright)\n2. **02_Shop** — store header (Home/Shop/Products/Pages, search/account/wishlist/cart, current Shop), page title \"Fashion\" + breadcrumb, toolbar (sort Best selling, view grid/list current grid), filters sidebar (Size, Colors, Prices, Brands, Collections, Tags), 9 product cards (Linen-blend Shirt Sold Out), pagination, collection banner, features, newsletter, instagram, store footer\n3. **03_Product** — store header (current Products), gallery (main Blue_2 + 6 thumbnails), summary (FASCO, Denim Jacket, rating (3), $39.00, old $59.00, Save 33%), options (Size M/L/XL/XXL selected M; Color Blue/Black/Lilac selected Blue), urgency (24 people viewing, sale ends 00:05:59:47, only 9 left with stock bar), actions (Compare, Ask a question, Share), delivery info, purchase