{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark: build a complete FASCO fashion e-commerce website design inside the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI/ (fileKey `raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI`). Requirements:\n   - Verify account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami (done, confirmed)\n   - Read「00·Start Here」for the brief,「01·Foundations」for visual rules, reuse「02·Components」components, use「04·Media」assets\n   - Deliver ALL work to「03·Workspace」page (node 8:2, initially empty) of this same file — do NOT create another file, do NOT switch accounts, do NOT modify/replace the reference pages (00/01/02/04 must stay intact)\n   - Build exactly 11 frames named exactly: 01_Home, 02_Shop, 03_Product, 04_Mini_Cart, 05_Cart, 06_Checkout, 07_Sign_Up, 08_Sign_In, 09_Forgot_Password, 10_Confirmation_Code, 11_New_Password\n   - Desktop web 1920 wide, light mode; sign-in pages are one screen 1920×1080; store pages scroll vertically\n   - Fixed: brand color #000000, fonts Volkhov (wordmark/headings) + Poppins (all other UI); all copy/data verbatim; media assets; given Button + Text Field components\n   - Mine to decide: all other colors, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation, grid, layout, all states (current nav/tab/slide, selected size/color/view, sold out, checked, cart count)\n   - Wire all listed prototype links\n   - Verify with screenshots of ALL screens; fix visible problems\n   - Finish with: assigned file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, remaining limitations\n   - CRITICAL FORMAT RULE: every assistant message with a tool call