{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark: build a complete FASCO fashion e-commerce website design inside the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI/ (fileKey `raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI`). Requirements:\n   - Account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai confirmed via whoami (done in earlier segment)\n   - Read「00·Start Here」brief,「01·Foundations」visual rules, reuse「02·Components」(Button 1:24, Text Field 1:27), use「04·Media」assets (all are COMPONENT nodes — instantiate via `.createInstance()`)\n   - Deliver ALL work to「03·Workspace」page (node 8:2) of this same file — do NOT create another file, do NOT switch accounts, do NOT modify/replace reference pages (00/01/02/04 stay intact)\n   - Build exactly 11 frames named: 01_Home, 02_Shop, 03_Product, 04_Mini_Cart, 05_Cart, 06_Checkout, 07_Sign_Up, 08_Sign_In, 09_Forgot_Password, 10_Confirmation_Code, 11_New_Password\n   - Desktop web 1920 wide, light mode; sign-in pages 1920×1080; store pages scroll vertically\n   - Fixed: brand color #000000, Volkhov (wordmark/headings) + Poppins (all other UI); all copy/data verbatim; wire ALL listed prototype links\n   - Verify with screenshots of ALL screens; fix visible problems; finish with file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype summary, limitations\n   - CRITICAL FORMAT RULE: every assistant message containing a tool call must begin with a visible decision summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; final answer starts `Reasoning summary: ...` on first line then `Final answer:`\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (JS ≤50k chars/call; helpers must be re-declared every call)\n   - FORBIDDEN APIs: `loadAllPagesAsync`, `setPluginData`, `createImageAsync`; page switching only `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)`\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 1: Failed use_figma calls ROLL BACK entirely** — no partial state persists after errors\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 2: Hidden children in components are STRIPPED from instances** — invisible nodes don't exist in instance subtrees\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 3: Instance-child visibility is one-way** — setting visible=false strips the node; it cannot be re-shown (findOne returns null afterwards). Only hide things not needed later on that instance\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 4: Instance-child position (x/y) cannot be overridden** (\"This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform\") — use frame-level overlay elements instead\n   - Allowed instance-child overrides: text characters, text fills, node fills, visibility (one-way hide)\n   - **Photo override trick (PhotoCover)**: instance photo components can't be swapped, so place a separate photo instance at the exact photo-area coordinates ON TOP of the card instance\n   - Fonts must be loaded at top of EVERY call before any fontName/characters change: Poppins Regular/Medium/SemiBold + Volkhov Bold (Poppins \"SemiBold\" spelled without space)\n   - `await` inside non-async arrow functions (forEach) = SyntaxError; use regular for loops\n   - Prototype wiring: `node.reactions = [{action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId},trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}}]` — wire after all frames exist; header component-level links set inside main components\n   - Design system: container 1400px centered (x=260); colors: ink #000000, text #1A1A1F, sub #6E6E76, mute #9A9AA3, surf #F4F4F6, bord #E4E4E9, sale #D6453D, gold #F2B01E, green #2E7D4F, footer #0B0B0E; Volkhov Bold display (44/100/130), Poppins Medium/SemiBold/Regular 11–20; radii 10 buttons/inputs, 14–24 cards\n   - Frame placement: 01@(0,0), 02@(2200,0), 03@(4400,0), 04@(6600,0), 05@(8800,0), 06@(11000,0), 07@(13200,0), 08@(15400,0), 09@(17600,0), 10@(19800,0), 11@(22000,0); components parked at x=24600\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI**, workspace page 8:2, set as current page earlier\n   - **Working helper pattern** (re-declare every call; fonts loaded first):\n     ```js\n     await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:\"Regular\"});\n     await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:\"Medium\"});\n     await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:\"SemiBold\"});\n     await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Volkhov\",style:\"Bold\"});\n     const F=(hex,o=1)=>{const n=parseInt(hex.slice(1),16);return {type:\"SOLID\",color:{r:(n>>16&255)/255,g:(n>>8&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255},opacity:o};};\n     const C={ink:\"#000000\",text:\"#1A1A1F\",sub:\"#6E6E76\",mute:\"#9A9AA3\",surf:\"#F4F4F6\",bord:\"#E4E4E9\",sale:\"#D6453D\"};\n     async function T(parent,chars,o={}){const{f=\"Poppins\",s=\"Regular\",size=16,color=C.text,x=0,y=0,w=null,ls=0,lh=null,align=\"LEFT\",name}=o;const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:f,style:s};t.fontSize=size;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[F(color)];if(ls)t.letterSpacing={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:ls};if(lh)t.lineHeight={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:lh};t.textAlignHorizontal=align;if(w){t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\";t.resize(w,t.height);}else{t.textAutoResize=\"WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT\";}if(name)t.name=name;parent.appendChild(t);t.x=x;t.y=y;return t;}\n     async function inst(id,parent,x,y,w,h,name){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();parent.appendChild(i);i.x=x;i.y=y;if(w&&h)i.resize(w,h);if(name)i.name=name;return i;}\n     function div(parent,x,y,w){const d=figma.createRectangle();d.resize(w,1);d.fills=[F(C.bord)];parent.appendChild(d);d.x=x;d.y=y;return d;}\n     function sv(node,nm,val,tag){const n=node.findOne(c=>c.name===nm);if(!n){log.push(\"MISS \"+tag+\" \"+nm);return;}n.visible=val;} // null-safe visibility sett