ldren: NavHome (text), NavDeals, NavNew, NavPackages, SignIn (text), SignUp (Button instance)\n- Wire NavHome→01, SignIn→08, SignUp→07 at component level so Home page inherits.\n- 11:12 children: NavHome, NavShop, NavProducts, NavPages, IconSearch, IconAccount, IconStar, IconCart, CartBadge, CartCount.\n- Wire NavHome→01, NavShop→02, IconAccount→08, IconCart→05.\n\nBut wait: 04_Mini_Cart is a CLONE of 03_Product — its header is an instance of 11:12, inherits component reactions. IconCart→05 on 04 is fine too.\n\nOne caveat: reactions set at component level on 11:12 — instances inherit. On the 02_Shop frame, cards→03 wiring: cards are instances of 13:39; I wire the instances inside frame 24:278 (not the component — different destinations per card all →03, fine).\n\nAlso 01_Home: cardArrival instances — no links required (entry-only list: New Arrivals tabs/cards no links? The brief's link list from summary: 01: ShopNowBtn→02, ViewMore→02, SignIn→08, SignUp→07; cards not wired). OK.\n\nDestination IDs must be FRAME node ids: 01_Home=15:44 etc.\n\nTransition: add simple default (no transition property → instant). Brief didn't require animations. Keep default.\n\nEdge: setting reactions on nodes inside main components (11:2/11:12) — these components live on workspace page at x=24600 (parked). They're visible components; wiring OK.\n\nAlso: headerHome NavDeals→02? Brief says Deals entry-only NO link. OK.\n\nLet me also double check \"SignIn\" text node name in headerHome is \"SignIn\" and \"SignUp\" is the Button instance name. From Call B summary: NavHome \"Home\" current, NavDeals, NavNew, NavPackages, SignIn, SignUp=Button instance. Yes.\n\nWrite the wiring call with logging.","signature":"2157620aa3e24a5aab08d764"}],"id":"e990ae21-e065-4535-90bd-22ec144a56ff","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"