{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark: build a complete FASCO fashion e-commerce website design inside the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI/ (fileKey `raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI`). Requirements:\n   - Account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai confirmed via whoami (done in earliest segment)\n   - Read「00·Start Here」brief,「01·Foundations」visual rules, reuse「02·Components」(Button 1:24, Text Field 1:27), use「04·Media」assets (all are COMPONENT nodes — instantiate via `.createInstance()`)\n   - Deliver ALL work to「03·Workspace」page (node 8:2) of this same file — do NOT create another file, do NOT switch accounts, do NOT modify/replace reference pages (00/01/02/04 stay intact)\n   - Build exactly 11 frames named: 01_Home, 02_Shop, 03_Product, 04_Mini_Cart, 05_Cart, 06_Checkout, 07_Sign_Up, 08_Sign_In, 09_Forgot_Password, 10_Confirmation_Code, 11_New_Password\n   - Desktop web 1920 wide, light mode; sign-in pages 1920×1080; store pages scroll vertically\n   - Fixed: brand color #000000, Volkhov (wordmark/headings) + Poppins (all other UI); all copy/data verbatim; wire ALL listed prototype links\n   - Verify with screenshots of ALL screens; fix visible problems; finish with file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype summary, limitations\n   - CRITICAL FORMAT RULE: every assistant message containing a tool call must begin with a visible decision summary prefixed exactly `Reasoning summary:`; final answer starts `Reasoning summary: ...` on first line then `Final answer:`\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (JS ≤50k chars/call; helpers must be re-declared every call)\n   - FORBIDDEN APIs: `loadAllPagesAsync`, `setPluginData`, `createImageAsync`\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 1: Failed use_figma calls ROLL BACK entirely** — no partial state persists after errors (confirmed again: wiring call exceeding 48KB return was not committed)\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 2: Hidden children in components are STRIPPED from instances**\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 3: Instance-child visibility is one-way** — hide strips node; cannot re-show\n   - **ENVIRONMENT RULE 4: Instance-child position (x/y) cannot be overridden** (\"relative-transform\" error) — use frame-level overlay elements\n   - Allowed instance-child overrides: text characters, text fills, node fills, visibility (one-way), and **reactions** (instance-child reaction overrides work)\n   - **NEW REACTIONS SCHEMA (this file's environment)**: old `{action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigationType:\"NAVIGATE\"}}` FAILS. Working format (validated):\n     ```js\n     node.reactions=[{actions:[{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:dest,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.2,easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"}}}],trigger:{type:\"ON_CLICK\"}}]\n     ```\n     Key: uses `actions` (array) not `action`; `navigation:\"NAVIGATE\"` (string, not navigationType); transition REQUIRED with `{type:\"DISSOLVE\"|\"SMART_ANIMATE\"|\"SCROLL_ANIMATE\", duration:<num>, easing:{type:\"EASE_OUT\"|\"EASE_IN_AND_OUT\"|\"LINEAR\"}}` (INSTANT invalid)\n   - **Components cannot be prototype sources** — setting reactions on nodes inside main components fails: \"the source may not be a valid prototype source... destinations must be a different top-level frame on the same page\". Wire headers per-frame on instance children instead.\n   - **Self-navigation rejected** — destination must be a DIFFERENT top-level frame; skip current-page self-links\n   - Return values must stay small (<48KB): join logs into one string, return compact objects\n   - `get_screenshot`: do NOT pass sessionId (invalid session errors); NO shell/Read tools exist in this session — use `enableBase64Response:true` to view images inline\n   - Fonts must be loaded at top of EVERY call: Poppins Regular/Medium/SemiBold (spelled \"SemiBold\" no space) + Volkhov Bold\n   - `await` inside non-async forEach = SyntaxError; use regular for loops\n   - Right-aligned text in fixed-width cards: place at `x = rightEdge - t.width` (x with auto-width text grows rightward and gets clipped by card bounds)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI**, workspace page 8:2 (all work here)\n   - **Helper pattern** (re-declare every call):\n     ```js\n     await figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Poppins\",style:\"Regular\"}); //+ Medium, SemiBold, Volkhov Bold\n     const F=(hex,o=1)=>{const n=parseInt(hex.slice(1),16);return {type:\"SOLID\",color:{r:(n>>16&255)/255,g:(n>>8&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255},opacity:o};};\n     const C={ink:\"#000000\",text:\"#1A1A1F\",sub:\"#6E6E76\",mute:\"#9A9AA3\",surf:\"#F4F4F6\",bord:\"#E4E4E9\",sale:\"#D6453D\",green:\"#2E7D4F\"};\n     async function T(parent,chars,o={}){const{f=\"Poppins\",s=\"Regular\",size=16,color=C.text,x=0,y=0,w=null,ls=0,lh=null,align=\"LEFT\",name}=o;const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:f,style:s};t.fontSize=size;t.characters=chars;t.fills=[F(color)];if(ls)t.letterSpacing={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:ls};if(lh)t.lineHeight={unit:\"PIXELS\",value:lh};t.textAlignHorizontal=align;if(w){t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\";t.resize(w,t.height);}else{t.textAutoResize=\"WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT\";}if(name)t.name=name;parent.appendChild(t);t.x=x;t.y=y;return t;}\n     async function inst(id,parent,x,y,w,h,name){const c=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=c.createInstance();parent.appendChild(i);i.x=x;i.y=y;if(w&&h)i.resize(w,h);if(name)i.name=name;return i;}\n     async function field(parent,label,ph,x,y,w,name){const f=await inst(\"1:27\",parent,x,y,w,87,name);const lb=f.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Label\");lb.characters=label;const pl=f.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Placeholder\");pl.characters=ph;return f;}\n     ```\n   - **ALL 11 FRAME IDs (complete)**: 01_Home=15:44 @ (0,0) 1920×5670; 02_Shop=24:278 @ (2200,0) 1920×4110; 03_Product=25:433 @ (4400,0) 1920×3340; 04_Mini_Cart=26:550 @ (6600,0) 1920×3340 (clone of 25:433); 05_Cart=27:675 @ (8800,0) 1920×1520; 06_Checkout=28:704 @ (11000,0) 1920×1800; 07_Sign_Up=29:765 @ (13200,0) 1920×1080; 08_Sign_In=29:807 @ (15400,0) 1920×1080; 09_Forgot_Password=29:833 @ (17600,0) 1920×1080; 10_Confirmation_Code=29:858 @ (19800,0) 1920×1080; 11_New_Password=29:871 @ (22000,0) 1920×1080\n   - **Workspace components parked at x=24600**: 10:2 checkbox (children Box, Check visible default), 10:5 starRow, 10:16 stepper (Minus/Qty/Plus), 10:20 social (Logo, Label), 10:39 btnOutline, 10:41 btnWhite, 11:2 headerHome, 11:12 headerStore, 11:29 footerHome, 11:39 footerStore, 12:7 collectionBanner, 12:20 features, 12:40 newsletter, 12:51 instagram, 13:16 cardArrival, 13:39 cardShop (SoldOutOverlay/OldPrice visible default), 13:48 dealSlider (Heading, Copy overridable)\n   - **Given components**: Button 1:24 (207×56, text override: `btn.findOne(n=>n.type===\"TEXT\")` then fontName Medium/size 15/characters), Text Field 1:27 (children Label, Input, Placeholder)\n   - **04·Media key IDs**: denim photos 165×220: Black_1 6:45, Black_2 6:70, Blue_1 6:46, Blue_2 6:47, Blue_3 6:48, Lilac 6:49; Photo_Sign_In 6:80, Photo_Sign_Up 6:63; icons: Account 6:15, Cart 6:16, Chevron_Down 6:17, Chevron_Left 6:20, Chevron_Right 6:21, Close 6:22, Compare 6:24, Delivery 6:25, Eye 6:26, Guarantee 6:28, Lock 6:29, Question 6:30, Returns 6:31, Search 6:33, Share 6:34, Star 6:37, View_Grid 6:41, View_List 6:42\n   - **03_Product (25:433) layout details needed for fixes**: headerStore instance (badge hidden, NavProducts ink/frame-level marker @ nProd.x+nProd.width/2-12, y=68); gallery main 6:47 @ (260,190) 600×800; 6 thumbs 92×123 @ y=1014 x=260+k*104 (thumb