Sign in with Email\"); OR divider; fields 520×87 (First/Last 252 each); primary button 520×56; links SemiBold 14\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **Reactions setter failures (3 attempts)**: (a) First wiring call: every wire threw; ALSO return value exceeded 48000-byte limit (103976 bytes) so edits rolled back — fix: null-safe wire, join log to single string. (b) Still all ERR. (c) Probe captured real error: new schema rejects `{action:{...}}` shape. Iterative probing (T1–T4, E1–E3) revealed required `actions` array + `navigation` + `transition` with easing/duration; error \"Please update the `actions` field instead of the `action` field\". Fix: working format documented above; then all 27 frame-level links OK.\n   - **Component-level wiring rejected**: reactions on nodes inside main components 11:2/11:12 → \"destination 15:44 was rejected — the source may not be a valid prototype source... destinations must be a different top-level frame on the same page\". Fix: wire header links per-frame on the header INSTANCE's children (tested OK on 15:44 NavHome), then applied to all 6 store frames + 01 → 20/23 OK.\n   - **Self-link rejection**: 01.NavHome→15:44, 02.NavShop→24:278, 05.IconCart→27:675 failed — destination must differ from source frame. Resolution: intentionally skip self-links (current page needs no link to itself); prototype wiring is complete.\n   - **get_screenshot Invalid sessionId**: retried without sessionId param — works.\n   - **No way to view screenshots locally**: no Bash/Read tools in this session — fix: `enableBase64Response:true` returns inline base64 image.\n   - **VISUAL BUGS FOUND (pending fixes)**: (1) 03_Product/04_Mini_Cart: Compare/Ask a question/Share actions row (y=798) overlaps Add to cart button (y=762–810, x=1096–1296) — plan: move actions row to ~y=824, Div2 to ~y=858, nudge delivery rows. (2) Right-aligned card values clipped at card edge in 05_Cart (SubVal y=108, TotVal y=146), 06_Checkout OrderSummary (SumPrice y=114, SubVal y=354, ShipVal y=386, TotVal y=436), 04_Mini_Cart drawer (SubVal y=432) — fix: `t.x = 416 - t.width` (right edge target 416 in 440-wide cards). (3) 05_Cart RowStepper Qty shows \"01\" while 03/04 show \"1\" — plan: set to \"1\" for consistency.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Complete frame-build pipeline working reliably: fonts → helpers → remove-old-by-name → build → return small object with ID\n   - Prototype reactions fully solved after schema discovery (new `actions` format) and source/destination constraints (no components, no self-links)\n   - Screenshot verification loop established via enableBase64Response; 01, 02, 07 fully verified clean; 03/04/05/06 verified with fixable issues listed above\n   - All 35 intended links wired: 27 frame-level + 20 header-instance links minus 3 intentional self-link skips\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Initial task (Chinese, first segment): “请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计：Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/raTuJeRXANVtA5RLmrbBWI/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。”\n   - (Task setup context): Use only the assigned file; confirm account zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai; preserve all reference pages and their nodes; build in 03·Workspace; benchmark read-only rules apply to reference pages, not workspace; use whoami → get_metadata → read-only use_figma inspection → use_figma building → get_screenshot verification; load fonts before text edits; add prototype interactions after screens exist; inspect screenshots of ALL required screens and fix problems; unattended session — resolve routine choices from the brief; finish with file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work, limitations; always prefix tool-call messages with \"Reasoning summary:\" and end with \"Reasoning summary: ... / Final answer: ...\"\n   - No new user messages in this segment (only tool results and system reminders)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Fix 03_Product (25:433): move Compare/Ask/Share actions row 